ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN_w4WF7SI1SogZYIf2IuuAsci2LN5SuQBr7tjUHdevkA&oe=6ADF6C4E"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00000.png", "id": "1881208279237958", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301236_1881208282571291_7560146938516804686_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VXJ1aseP77cQ7kNvwGFXUeU&_nc_oc=Adpt-SfBhWcLrsoK7mg9rQT8HAF102u6Gl5yOpORJ3Hty1zQYSgY9lQc1L2pDaDU1VA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPCdogBIShJZBDysm2LFY4gnZSv-WfIDB-qNFoDmO0bKg&oe=6ADF632A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Omni First Steps", "keywords": ["virtuix", "omni", "one", "first", "steps"], "long_description": "Take your first steps into full-body VR.\n\nFirst Steps is the guided introduction to Omni One, Virtuix's full-body VR gaming system. Explore beautiful environments as you learn how to walk, turn, and move on Omni One.\n\nDesigned for new users, First Steps provides a simple and enjoyable introduction to full-body VR movement and helps you get comfortable before jumping into your favorite games. Wander through ancient Roman ruins, stroll the streets of a charming Paris neighborhood, and test your confidence crossing a bridge suspended high above a canyon.\n\n**Requires Omni One hardware. First Steps is designed for use with an Omni One system.**", "short_description": "Take your first steps into full-body VR. First Steps is the guided introduction to Omni One, Virtuix's full-body VR gaming system. \n\nLearn how to walk, turn, and move naturally while exploring immersive environments, including ancient Roman ruins, a charming Paris neighborhood, and a bridge suspended high above a canyon. Designed for new users, First Steps helps you build confidence before jumping into supported games.\n\nRequires Omni One hardware."}]}, "developer_name": "Virtuix", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtuix.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_serv