 exploring immersive environments, including ancient Roman ruins, a charming Paris neighborhood, and a bridge suspended high above a canyon. Designed for new users, First Steps helps you build confidence before jumping into supported games.\n\nRequires Omni One hardware."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtuix.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtuix Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://virtuix.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1155237367675106"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1645678453176436"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1645678453176436"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1782218220, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1645678453176436"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1179379375260905", "version": "1.0.1"}, "id": "1568865205240057", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1111410428724467", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1179379375260905"}, "release_s